        "Name",
        "Reference",
        "IsActive"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Lookup only. Alexander James 2026-10-29: GET /CreditCards?filters=IsActive,eq,true&fields=CreditCardID,Name,Reference",
        "Lucy needs each card on her General tab before a live charge will post"
